# Margin Captions

## Figures
  {:label: sec-figs}

Captions sit in the right-hand column when there is room for it, and under
their block otherwise. This paragraph is long enough to wrap onto more than one
line so the text column has a clear right edge to measure against.

:figure: {
  :label: fig-a
  :path: figure-light.png
}
:caption: The first figure, with a short caption.
::

A paragraph between the first figure and the next two, which sit close
together so the caption of the first one is pushed against the second.

:figure: {
  :label: fig-b
  :path: figure-light.png
  :scale: 0.3
}
:caption: A small figure with a long caption. It goes on for a while so that,
in the margin column, it runs well past the bottom of its own figure and would
overlap the caption of the figure that follows straight after it, unless the
column pushes that caption down. More words to make sure it is long enough to
do that at any width the column can have, and then a few more.
::

:figure: {
  :label: fig-c
  :path: figure-light.png
  :scale: 0.3
}
:caption: The figure right after the long caption.
::

## Other blocks
  {:label: sec-other}

A table, a widget and a video, each with a caption.

:table: {
  :label: tab-a
}

:tbody:

:tr: :td:one:: :td:two:: :td:three:: ::

:tr: :td:four:: :td:five:: :td:six:: ::

::

:caption: A table caption.

::

Text between the table and the widget.

:html: {
  :label: wid-a
}

<div style="width:300px;height:120px;background:#406;color:#fff">widget</div>

:caption: A widget caption.
::

Text between the widget and the video.

:video: {
  :label: vid-a
  :path: demo.mp4
}
:caption: A video caption.
::

## A wide table
  {:label: sec-wide}

This table is wider than the text column, so it scrolls sideways inside its
own box.

:table: {
  :label: tab-wide
}

:tbody:

:tr: :td:aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa:: :td:bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb:: :td:cccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccccc:: ::

::

:caption: A wide table caption.

::

Closing paragraph after every captioned block, so the page has text below the
last block as well.
